    "detailed_description": "<i>Chiaroscuro </i>is a 2D adventure platformer with metroidvania elements.  Explore a world that has fallen into darkness and discover the Lights to illuminate your forgotten past.<br><br><u><u>INVESTIGATE A MEMORY LOSS CATASTROPHE</u></u><br>In a world where 95% of the population has suddenly forgotten pieces of their past, take the role of Rose, a mysterious amnesiac and go on an adventure to seek out the Lights: magical objects that have been rumored to restore the memories of those who find them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/c997a82b4fabe02084713f8bc05574a0.poster.avif?t=1749482741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/c997a82b4fabe02084713f8bc05574a0.webm?t=1749482741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><u>CHALLENGE DANGEROUS THREATS</u><br>Rose is not the only one seeking out these powerful Lights.  Using quick and responsive combat, battle your way through dangerous situations by swinging your trusty thorn and casting a plethora of elemental spells.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/d9027fe58ef578002e527f66af51f97b.poster.avif?t=1749482741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/d9027fe58ef578002e527f66af51f97b.webm?t=1749482741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/d9027fe58ef578002e527f66af51f97b.mp4?t=1749482741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</u><br>Throughout your adventure in search of the Lights, you will gain a wide range of abilities that will assist you in furthering your quest through over a dozen unique environments, in addition to backtracking through locations you\u2019ve already explored using tight and satisfying platforming.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/3c835a2ed904d02463c95ee3fa6fbec5.poster.avif?t=1749482741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/3c835a2ed904d02463c95ee3fa6fbec5.webm?t=1749482741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411260/extras/3c835a2ed904d02463c95ee3fa6fbec5.mp4?t=1749482741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>FEATURES</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A riveting and interactive storyline.<br></li><li>Challenging combat and platforming.<br></li><li>Tight and satisfying gameplay.<br></li><li>A variety of gameplay mechanics through the use of elemental casting.<br></li><li>Uncover the mysterious history of Chiaroscuro through optional side-quests and be rewarded for exploration.</li></ul>Add Chiaroscuro to your Wishlist to be reminded when it releases!<br><br><strong>Before giving the demo a go, please read and consider the following:  </strong><br><br><strong>This version is an alpha version from <u>August 2020</u> that showcases the general feel of the game, not the final product.  </strong><br><br><strong>Do note this alpha demo does not completely support resolution scaling and the recommended resolution for this alpha demo is 1920x1080.  I plan on updating the demo once I get around to implementing accurate game scaling options.</strong>",
